<h1>Add a Beer</h1>

<p>Finds the oldest review in your Untappd RSS feed that isn't on the site yet, and adds it.</p>

<form class="form" method="get" action="/.netlify/functions/import-next-review">
	<button type="submit" class="button">Import next review from RSS</button>
</form>

<p><a href="/.netlify/functions/resolve-instagram-links">Resolve Instagram links</a> for beers with a pending Buffer post.</p>

<h2>Add manually</h2>

<form class="form" method="get" action="/.netlify/functions/parse-review-url">
	<div class="field">
		<label for="token">Token</label>
		<input type="text" name="token" id="token">
	</div>
	<div class="field">
		<label for="url">URL</label>
		<input type="text" name="url" id="URL">
	</div>
	<button type="submit" class="button">Add</button>
</form>
